  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Every day, you used to ride a dreary train to the office. One day, the train never reached your station: your commute ended in screeching wheels, crumpling metal, and choking smoke. You emerged from the smoldering wreck unharmed but undeniably changed, your body warped by the impossible supernatural violence it endured.</p><p>You found yourself at an office complex you didn't recognize, a looming building called Mordenheim Kinetics. With nothing else for miles but crashing ocean waves and a silent, fog-shrouded forest, you had no choice but to enter the campus. Maybe you were looking for help, a phone, anything to make sense of the carnage you had just survived. But the more you search its austere buildings, the more you fear it may all be in vain.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.GK7VmFMPLApUJGBk]{Aberrant Anatomy} or a Dark Gift feat of your choice</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and Investigation</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Gaming Set</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Gaming Set, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBook0000000]{Book} (horror novel), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagFlask000000]{Flask}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLock0000000]{Lock}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagSignalWhist]{Signal Whistle}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 11 GP (as 11 dollars); or (B) 50 GP (as 50 dollars)</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
